+| SCENARIO-KAN-5242 | Bounded certificate stress reports scale boundary | Implemented | Artifact reproduces the Exp 5230 baseline, verifies the more_pwa_segments and wider_input_bounds stress cases at pwa_piece_count=10, records the wider input box [-0.5, 0.75] over two variables, and rejects the deliberate_false_property case with threshold=0.84; the completed claim is limited to this bounded KAEM/PWA fixture. |
